## Expansion gate

Expand one bounded round when a configured route condition is met, a selected
file proves another contract or consumer is affected, or required evidence is
missing. Report the reason, new files/modules, and revised budget. Crossing the
approved task scope still requires `GATE-02` reapproval.

## Context hygiene

- Keep one task/chat per coherent outcome.
- Persist durable decisions in authority documents or ADRs, not long prompts.
- Prefer a concise phase snapshot after approval, implementation, and
  verification.
- Parallel investigation may reduce wall-clock time but can increase total
  tokens; use it only for stable, non-overlapping work packages.

